imself to save her.\n\n\nRiven quietly asks:\n\n\"Why?\"\n\n\nAlly looks at her weakly.\n\nHe answers:\n\n\"You would've done the same.\"\n\n\nAlly dies in Riven's arms.\n\n\nRiven remains holding him.\n\nThe other SOLDIERS remain standing in the surrounding area.\n\nThey do not collapse.\n\nDo not show any other character falling or dying.\n\n\nAfter a quiet moment,\nRiven slowly looks into the distance.\n\n\nFar across the valley,\nthick dark smoke rises from the direction of her home village.\n\nA distant orange fire glow is visible beneath the smoke.\n\nHer home village is burning.\n\n\nRiven stares at the distant fire.\n\nThen she slowly looks back down at Ally.\n\n\nStill devastated,\nRiven carefully lowers Ally's body onto the ground.\n\nRiven remains beside him.\n\nCUT.", "ref_objects": [{"object_type": 1, "image": {"uri": "tos-mya-i-uo7y4d541q/d8d36978b9494032a350f12afdf8b061.png", "key": "", "request_id": "", "gender": 0}}, {"object_type": 1, "image": {"uri": "tos-mya-i-uo7y4d541q/a381f63ca7f34d729737f7c6fdbbde72.png", "key": "", "request_id": "", "gender": 0}}, {"object_type": 1, "image": {"uri": "tos-mya-i-uo7y4d541q/edc98d1baba045c894045c67916fb1b7.png", "key": "", "request_id": "", "gender": 0}}, {"object_type": 1, "image": {"uri": "tos-mya-i-uo7y4d541q/9f6ed3251b5948c8a86bf0a50e4e7014.png", "key": "", "request_id": "", "gender": 0}}, {"object_type": 1, "image": {"uri": "tos-mya-i-uo7y4d541q/5c9502a40839409b9052dba1907e3c94.png", "key": "", "request_id": "", "gender": 0}}], "result": {"object_type": 2, "video": {"vid": "v186a3gm000cdas9d1vog65kh7msogv0", "download_url": "http://v16-dola.dola.com/581ab068d249c60b0bd0900cbe3dc532/7d8499ca/video/tos/mya/tos-mya-ve-50851/oMYYueaNhIEuql9FEqJwKaDpFHfQxBpCSEw47u/", "duration": 30.079999923706055, "video_type": "mp4", "video_model": {"status": 10, "message": "success", "enable_ssl": true, "auto_definition": "360p", "enable_adaptive": false, "video_id": "v186a3gm000cdas9d1vog65kh7msogv0", "video_duration": 30.0